            summary: 'Fix for #1241: first input position must be a valid match reference even on first use of a context. The root cause is in ZSTD_window_init/ZSTD_window_clear (lib/compress/zstd_compress_internal.h ~lines 518, 617-640), where the window is initialized/anchored with a base reference of 0. Starting the reference at 1 (dictLimit/lowLimit initialized to 1 instead of 0) avoids the problematic 0 position, so index 0 is never treated as a valid match start on first usage of the context, keeping ZSTD_getLowestMatchIndex and match-finding window logic correct.',
            model_context_handles: [Array],
            response_capture_sha256: '20f1b2895652a82898aca80f3ab51ef4612288bf7cffac15ea20408f0abb4f49',
