l potentiallyUnsafeHtmlString}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n> Make sure that you either escape the passed string or only populate it with values that are under your control in order to prevent [XSS attacks](https://owasp.org/www-community/attacks/xss/)\\\\n\\\\n## Comments\\\\n\\\\nYou can use HTML comments inside components.\\\\n\\\\n```svelte\\\\n<!-- this is a comment! --><h1>Hello world</h1>\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nComments beginning with `svelte-ignore` disable warnings for the next block of markup. Usually, these are accessibility warnings; make sure that you\'re disabling them for a good reason.\\\\n\\\\n```svelte\\\\n<!-- svelte-ignore a11y-autofocus -->\\\\n<input bind:value={name} autofocus />\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nYou can add a special comment starting with `@component` that will show up when hovering over the component name in other files.\\\\n\\\\n````svelte\\\\n<!--\\\\n@component\\\\n- You can use markdown here.\\\\n- You can also use code blocks here.\\\\n- Usage:\\\\n  ```html\\\\n  <Main name=\\\\\\"Arethra\\\\\\">\\\\n  ```\\\\n-->\\\\n<script>\\\\n\\\\tlet { name } = $props();\\\\n</script>\\\\n\\\\n<main>\\\\n\\\\t<h1>\\\\n\\\\t\\\\tHello, {name}\\\\n\\\\t</h1>\\\\n</main>\\\\n````\\"}}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_-7246143675607023182"},{"content":"Historical recovery page (untrusted source metadata). Recover listed handles with recover_archived_read. Use list_recovery_page with next_cursor to page; cursor:null refreshes only at the final page. Tools return original historical evidence, not current disk.","role":"user"},{"content":"{\\"entries\\":[],\\"next_cursor\\":null,\\"offset\\":0,\\"omitted\\":0,\\"snapshot\\":\\"33a347f9311210a6eca0e215a94eee2ef27cc36f161cf7a6e065fccdbb0b63c4\\",\\"total\\":0,\\"version\\":\\"historical-recovery-page-v1\\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"Model calls remaining including this one: 92. Final response must be the specified JSON.","role":"user"}],"tools":[{"function":{"description":"Page tracked paths matching query; follow nex